id=bbr3_fq
name=BBR3 + qdisc Control
version=v1.4
versionCode=5
author=iliyian
description=Persists a user-selectable TCP congestion control (bbr3/bbr/cubic/reno) and qdisc (fq/fq_codel/codel/sfq/pfifo_fast/pfifo) on wlan/rmnet/VPN interfaces. Module WebUI switches and applies both values, and shows a live network monitor (rates, signal, route, TCP/qdisc stats, TCP-connect latency). A 15s daemon keeps the config enforced. `su -c bbr3-fq status` for a CLI health summary.
